("<h3>分鏡生成片</h3>", "<h3>Storyboarded generated film</h3>"),
("劇情、動作這類全靠生成的片走另一條流程：先排分鏡表，再產出提示詞送 VideoExpress，附 12 種畫風的規則。鏡頭回來後接成有對白、字幕和配樂的成片，或送進 Concat 自己修。", "Drama and action films that are generated end to end take a different flow: a shot table first, then prompts for VideoExpress, with rules for 12 visual styles. The returned shots are cut into a film with dialogue, subtitles and music, or sent to Concat for you to adjust."),
